        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy Patina- Image to Material\n\nTurn a photo of a surface into a seamless, tiling PBR material with Patina. The source image sets the pattern and Patina redraws it as a tileable material, returning basecolor, normal, roughness, metalness and height maps that line up pixel for pixel. Built for brick, stone, wood, plaster, fabric and ceramic tile; a mask can restrict the redraw to part of the image. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/api_patina_material_i2m.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
        },
